  "guard": {
    "comment": "Words that must not appear in text a person reads except through the terms helper, as code, or on quality/vocabulary-allow.json. Each entry belongs to a key of `words`; every themed word must have an entry (check.mjs fails without one). rules[].to says which form of the themed word replaces the match when scripts/vocabulary-fix applies an auto rule to documentation: one, many, number (plural when the match ends in s), do, does, did, doing, does_rb. labels are single-word captions (a button, a heading, a menu item) that are flagged only when written exactly so in the web or Go sources.",
    "denyAsProductWords": [
      "strike",
